    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P.F. Quirke & Co. Ltd. are delighted to present 22, Harbour House, a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse apartment enjoying a wonderful position overlooking the River Suir and towards the Comeragh Mountains.\n\n Its location at the rear of the building ensures a notably quiet and private setting, while Clonmel town centre and its extensive range of shops, restaurants, services and amenities are within easy reach.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises, Entrance hall, three well-proportioned bedrooms, all featuring built-in wardrobes, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a private en-suite, living room and kitchen/dining room. The generous living room is filled with natural light and opens directly onto a private balcony area, providing an excellent outdoor space from which to enjoy the views southwards towards the River Suir and Comeraghs. \n\nA good-sized kitchen/dining room provides a practical and sociable space, while the apartment also benefits from electric heating and has been newly redecorated throughout.\n\nPresented in turn-key condition, Apartment 22 is ready for immediate occupation and offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a spacious penthouse apartment in a quiet and convenient location.\n\n \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 7.63m (25'0\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\nCarpeted.\n\nLiving Room - 3.56m (11'8\") x 4.95m (16'3\")\nSliding door and access to the balcony.\n\nKitchen/dining - 4.45m (14'7\") x 3.44m (11'3\")\nBuilt in units at eye and floor level, sink, electric oven and rings, tiled splashback, tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.67m (15'4\") x 3.44m (11'3\")\nBuilt in wardrobe along one wall.\n\nEnsuite - 1.91m (6'3\") x 1.33m (4'4\")\nTiled walls and floor, w/c, sink and mains shower.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.97m (6'6\") x 1.74m (5'9\")\nBath, tiled walls and floors, w/c and sink.\n\nHotpress - 2.87m (9'5\") x 0.76m (2'6\")\nGood storage.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.06m (10'0\") x 3.92m (12'10\")\nBuilt in wardrobe space along one wall.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.92m (12'10\") x 3.82m (12'6\")\nBuilt in wardrobe along one wall with a french door leading to balcony.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Top floor apartment </li><li> Great storage space </li><li> Stunning views over Clonmel town and Comeragh Mountains </li><li> Electric heating </li><li> Newly redecorated throughout </li><li> Private balcony </li><li> Town centre location</li></ul>"
      },
